msgstr "Aucun envoi pour l'instant"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1166
msgid ""
"Deliveries appear here when a subscribed event happens, or when you send "
"a test event."
msgstr ""
"Les envois apparaissent ici lorsqu'un événement suivi se produit ou "
"lorsque vous envoyez un événement de test."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1177
msgid "Attempts"
msgstr "Tentatives"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1178
msgid "Response code"
msgstr "Code de réponse"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1179
msgid "Response"
msgstr "Réponse"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1201
#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1491
msgid "Newer"
msgstr "Plus récents"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1203
#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1493
msgid "Older"
msgstr "Plus anciens"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1223
msgid "Payload URL"
msgstr "URL de destination"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1225
msgid ""
"HTTPS only. Addresses inside private networks are refused when the "
"request is sent."
msgstr ""
"HTTPS uniquement. Les adresses de réseaux privés sont refusées lors de "
"l'envoi de la requête."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1228
msgid "Events"
msgstr "Événements"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1242
msgid "Include private issues and private notes"
msgstr "Inclure les tickets privés et les notes privées"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1244
msgid "Off by default: the receiver then never learns about private content."
msgstr ""
"Désactivé par défaut : le destinataire n'a alors jamais connaissance du "
"contenu privé."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1247
msgid ""
"Private issues and private notes are not sent. Only an administrator can "
"change that."
msgstr ""
"Les tickets privés et les notes privées ne sont pas envoyés. Seul un "
"administrateur peut changer cela."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1251
msgid "Generate a new secret"
msgstr "Générer un nouveau secret"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1252
msgid "The old secret stops working at once."
msgstr "L'ancien secret cesse immédiatement de fonctionner."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1256
msgid "A signing secret is generated and shown once after the webhook is created."
msgstr ""
"Un secret de signature est généré et affiché une seule fois après la "
"création du webhook."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1275
#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1285
msgid "Delete webhook"
msgstr "Supprimer le webhook"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1281
msgid "Delete this webhook and its delivery log? Nothing more is sent to:"
msgstr ""
"Supprimer ce webhook et son journal des envois ? Plus rien ne sera envoyé"
" à :"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1299
msgid "Failed to save the repository."
msgstr "Échec de l'enregistrement du dépôt."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1302
#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1337
msgid "Connect a repository"
msgstr "Connecter un dépôt"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1303
msgid "Edit repository"
msgstr "Modifier le dépôt"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1304
msgid "Connect repository"
msgstr "Connecter le dépôt"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1308
msgid "Never received"
msgstr "Jamais reçu"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1309
msgid "Accepted"
msgstr "Accepté"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1310
msgid "Duplicate"
msgstr "Doublon"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1311
msgid "Ignored"
msgstr "Ignoré"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1312
msgid "Processed"
msgstr "Traité"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1314
msgid "Enter the repository as owner/name."
msgstr "Saisissez le dépôt sous la forme propriétaire/nom."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1315
msgid "Enter the repository's http(s) address."
msgstr "Saisissez l'adresse http(s) du dépôt."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1316
msgid "Choose a merge status, or turn merge automation off."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez un statut de fusion, ou désactivez l'automatisation des "
"fusions."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1317
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Detected {provider} repository {repo}"
msgstr "Dépôt {provider} {repo} détecté"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1318
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Filled in repository {repo} from the URL"
msgstr "Dépôt {repo} renseigné à partir de l'URL"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1319
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Changing the provider gives this repository a new webhook URL and secret."
" The current webhook stops working at once; set it up again on "
"{provider}."
msgstr ""
"Changer de fournisseur donne à ce dépôt une nouvelle URL de webhook et un"
" nouveau secret. Le webhook actuel cesse de fonctionner immédiatement ; "
"configurez-le à nouveau sur {provider}."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1320
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The provider changed from {old} to {new}. The old webhook URL no longer "
"works: set the webhook up again on {new} with this URL and secret."
msgstr ""
"Le fournisseur est passé de {old} à {new}. L'ancienne URL de webhook ne "
"fonctionne plus : configurez à nouveau le webhook sur {new} avec cette "
"URL et ce secret."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1321
msgid "Enter an environment name, or a prefix ending in *."
msgstr "Saisissez un nom d'environnement, ou un préfixe se terminant par *."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1322
msgid "A prefix needs at least one character before the *."
msgstr "Un préfixe nécessite au moins un caractère avant le *."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1323
msgid "Use at most 255 characters."
msgstr "Utilisez 255 caractères au maximum."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1324
msgid "This environment is listed twice."
msgstr "Cet environnement figure deux fois."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1325
msgid "Choose a type."
msgstr "Choisissez un type."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1326
msgid "At most 100 environments can be listed."
msgstr "Vous pouvez indiquer 100 environnements au maximum."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1352
msgid "Webhook URL"
msgstr "URL du webhook"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1359
msgid "Secret"
msgstr "Secret"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1365
msgid "Copy the secret now: it is not shown again."
msgstr "Copiez le secret maintenant : il ne sera plus affiché."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1369
msgid ""
"In the repository on GitHub, open Settings, then Webhooks, then Add "
"webhook."
msgstr ""
"Dans le dépôt sur GitHub, ouvrez Settings, puis Webhooks, puis Add "
"webhook."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1370
msgid ""
"Paste the webhook URL into Payload URL and set Content type to "
"application/json."
msgstr ""
"Collez l'URL du webhook dans Payload URL et réglez Content type sur "
"application/json."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1371
#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1387
msgid "Paste the secret into Secret."
msgstr "Collez le secret dans Secret."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1372
msgid ""
"Choose \"Let me select individual events\", tick Pushes and Pull "
"requests, and save. GitHub sends a ping at once; it appears in the "
"delivery log."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez « Let me select individual events », cochez Pushes et Pull "
"requests, puis enregistrez. GitHub envoie aussitôt un ping, qui apparaît "
"dans le journal des envois."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1377
msgid ""
"In the project on GitLab, open Settings, then Webhooks, then Add new "
"webhook."
msgstr ""
"Dans le projet sur GitLab, ouvrez Settings, puis Webhooks, puis Add new "
"webhook."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1378
msgid "Paste the webhook URL into URL and the secret into Secret token."
msgstr "Collez l'URL du webhook dans URL et le secret dans Secret token."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1379
msgid "Under Trigger, select Push events and Merge request events."
msgstr "Sous Trigger, sélectionnez Push events et Merge request events."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1380
msgid "Save, then use Test, Push events to send a first delivery."
msgstr ""
"Enregistrez, puis utilisez Test, Push events pour envoyer un premier "
"envoi."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1385
msgid ""
"In the repository, open Settings, then Webhooks, then Add webhook, and "
"pick the Gitea or Forgejo webhook type, matching the server."
msgstr ""
"Dans le dépôt, ouvrez Settings, puis Webhooks, puis Add webhook, et "
"choisissez le type de webhook Gitea ou Forgejo selon le serveur."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1386
msgid ""
"Paste the webhook URL into Target URL. Keep the HTTP method POST and set "
"the POST content type to application/json."
msgstr ""
"Collez l'URL du webhook dans Target URL. Gardez la méthode HTTP POST et "
"réglez le POST content type sur application/json."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1388
msgid ""
"Under Trigger on, choose Custom events, tick Push and Pull request, then "
"add the webhook. Test delivery sends a push."
msgstr ""
"Sous Trigger on, choisissez Custom events, cochez Push et Pull request, "
"puis ajoutez le webhook. Test delivery envoie un push."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1406
msgid "No repositories connected"
msgstr "Aucun dépôt connecté"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1407
msgid ""
"Connect a GitHub, GitLab, Gitea or Forgejo repository: commits that "
"mention an issue key, such as \"Fixes KEY-12\", or are pushed to a branch"
" named after one, are linked to the issue."
msgstr ""
"Connectez un dépôt GitHub, GitLab, Gitea ou Forgejo : les commits qui "
"mentionnent une clé de ticket, comme « Fixes KEY-12 », ou qui sont "
"poussés sur une branche nommée d'après elle, sont liés au ticket."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1408
msgid "Connect the first repository"
msgstr "Connecter le premier dépôt"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1421
msgid "Last delivery:"
msgstr "Dernier envoi :"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1422
msgid "includes subprojects"
msgstr "inclut les sous-projets"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1424
msgid "commit commands on"
msgstr "commandes de commit activées"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1425
msgid "merge automation on"
msgstr "automatisation des fusions activée"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1430
msgid "New secret"
msgstr "Nouveau secret"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1463
msgid "Deliveries appear here once the forge sends its first webhook to this URL."
msgstr ""
"Les envois apparaissent ici dès que la forge envoie son premier webhook à"
" cette URL."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1513
msgid "Repository URL"
msgstr "URL du dépôt"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1516
msgid ""
"Paste the address of the repository's page, or its clone address. "
"Provider and Repository are filled in from it."
msgstr ""
"Collez l'adresse de la page du dépôt, ou son adresse de clonage. Le "
"fournisseur et le dépôt en sont déduits."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1520
msgid "Undo"
msgstr "Annuler"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1537
msgid "Repository"
msgstr "Dépôt"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1540
msgid ""
"The full name as the forge shows it, owner and repository. Deliveries "
"that name another repository are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Le nom complet tel que la forge l'affiche, propriétaire et dépôt. Les "
"envois qui désignent un autre dépôt sont ignorés."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1543
msgid "Issues commits may link to"
msgstr "Tickets auxquels les commits peuvent être liés"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1545
msgid "This project"
msgstr "Ce projet"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1546
msgid "This project and its subprojects"
msgstr "Ce projet et ses sous-projets"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1548
msgid "Keys of other projects in commit messages are ignored."
msgstr "Les clés d'autres projets dans les messages de commit sont ignorées."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1551
msgid "Changes to issues"
msgstr "Modifications des tickets"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1552
msgid ""
"Commit commands trust the commit author email, which anyone with push "
"access can set to any address. With commands on, anyone who can push to "
"this repository can act as any project member whose verified email they "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Les commandes de commit se fient à l'e-mail de l'auteur du commit, que "
"toute personne ayant le droit de push peut définir à n'importe quelle "
"adresse. Commandes activées, toute personne pouvant pousser sur ce dépôt "
"peut agir au nom de n'importe quel membre du projet dont elle utilise "
"l'e-mail vérifié."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1555
msgid "Commit commands"
msgstr "Commandes de commit"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1557
msgid ""
"\"Fixes KEY-12\" in a commit on the default branch moves the issue to the"
" fixing status, as the Specivo user whose verified email wrote the "
"commit. Their permissions and the workflow apply."
msgstr ""
"« Fixes KEY-12 » dans un commit sur la branche par défaut fait passer le "
"ticket au statut de correction, au nom de l'utilisateur Specivo dont "
"l'e-mail vérifié a écrit le commit. Ses permissions et le workflow "
"s'appliquent."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1559
msgid "Fixing status"
msgstr "Statut de correction"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1561
msgid "Do not change the status"
msgstr "Ne pas changer le statut"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1569
msgid "Time logging"
msgstr "Consignation du temps"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1571
msgid ""
"\"KEY-12 @1h30m\" (also @2h, @90m, @1.5h) logs the time on the issue for "
"the commit's author, on any branch. They need permission to log time."
msgstr ""
"« KEY-12 @1h30m » (ou @2h, @90m, @1.5h) consigne le temps sur le ticket "
"pour l'auteur du commit, sur n'importe quelle branche. Il lui faut la "
"permission de consigner du temps."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1575
msgid "Merge automation"
msgstr "Automatisation des fusions"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1577
msgid ""
"When a pull or merge request that says \"Fixes KEY-12\" is merged into "
"the default branch, the issue moves to the merge status. The change is "
"made by Git, with the project role chosen here, and follows the workflow."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu'une pull request ou merge request indiquant « Fixes KEY-12 » est "
"fusionnée dans la branche par défaut, le ticket passe au statut de "
"fusion. La modification est faite par Git, avec le rôle de projet choisi "
"ici, et suit le workflow."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1580
msgid "Merge status"
msgstr "Statut de fusion"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1582
msgid "Choose a status"
msgstr "Choisissez un statut"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1590
msgid "Role of Git in this project"
msgstr "Rôle de Git dans ce projet"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1596
msgid ""
"The Automation role may edit issues but has no workflow transitions until"
" an administrator grants them. Changing the role needs permission to "
"manage members."
msgstr ""
"Le rôle Automation peut modifier les tickets mais n'a aucune transition "
"de workflow tant qu'un administrateur ne les accorde pas. Changer le rôle"
" nécessite la permission de gérer les membres."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1602
msgid "Ignore pull requests from forks and outsiders"
msgstr "Ignorer les pull requests des forks et des personnes extérieures"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1604
msgid ""
"Requests from another repository, or on GitHub by someone who is not a "
"collaborator, are not linked to issues until they are merged."
msgstr ""
"Les requêtes provenant d'un autre dépôt, ou sur GitHub d'une personne qui"
" n'est pas collaboratrice, ne sont liées aux tickets qu'une fois "
"fusionnées."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1607
msgid "Environment types"
msgstr "Types d'environnement"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1608
msgid ""
"Deployments are grouped by environment type, guessed from the "
"environment's name (\"prod-eu\" is production). List the environments the"
" guess gets wrong. A name ending in * covers every environment that "
"starts with it, such as review/*. Names match in any case."
msgstr ""
"Les déploiements sont regroupés par type d'environnement, deviné à partir"
" du nom de l'environnement (« prod-eu » est de la production). Indiquez "
"les environnements pour lesquels la supposition est fausse. Un nom se "
"terminant par * couvre tous les environnements qui commencent ainsi, "
"comme review/*. La casse des noms est ignorée."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1613
msgid "Environment name or prefix*"
msgstr "Nom ou préfixe* de l'environnement"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1614
msgid "e.g. github-pages or review/*"
msgstr "p. ex. github-pages ou review/*"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1625
msgid "Choose a type"
msgstr "Choisissez un type"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1626
msgid "Production"
msgstr "Production"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1627
msgid "Staging"
msgstr "Préproduction"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1628
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "Test"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1633
msgid "Remove this environment"
msgstr "Retirer cet environnement"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1642
msgid "Add an environment"
msgstr "Ajouter un environnement"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1646
msgid ""
"A webhook URL and a secret are generated and shown once after the "
"repository is connected."
msgstr ""
"Une URL de webhook et un secret sont générés et affichés une seule fois "
"après la connexion du dépôt."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1665
msgid "Disconnect repository"
msgstr "Déconnecter le dépôt"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1671
msgid ""
"Disconnect this repository? Its webhook URL stops working and its "
"delivery log is deleted. Commit notes already on issues stay."
msgstr ""
"Déconnecter ce dépôt ? Son URL de webhook cesse de fonctionner et son "
"journal des envois est supprimé. Les notes de commit déjà présentes sur "
"les tickets sont conservées."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1684
#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/sprint_edit.html:98
msgid "Saved"
msgstr "Enregistré"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1685
msgid "Could not save the branch name settings."
msgstr "Impossible d'enregistrer les paramètres de nom de branche."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1690
msgid "Branch names"
msgstr "Noms de branche"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1692
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The \"Copy branch name\" button on an issue builds the name from this "
"format. {key} is the issue key and must be there; {type} comes from the "
"tracker; {slug} is the subject in lower case, at most 40 characters. "
"Branches named this way link their commits to the issue."
msgstr ""
"Le bouton « Copier le nom de branche » d'un ticket construit le nom à "
"partir de ce format. {key} est la clé du ticket et doit être présente ; "
"{type} vient du tracker ; {slug} est le sujet en minuscules, 40 "
"caractères au plus. Les commits des branches nommées ainsi sont liés au "
"ticket."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1694
msgid "Format"
msgstr "Format"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1696
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "Exemple :"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1706
msgid "Other trackers"
msgstr "Autres trackers"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1725
msgid "Search indexing"
msgstr "Indexation de la recherche"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1727
msgid ""
"Full-text search analyzer language for this project. Leave on Inherit to "
"use the instance default."
msgstr ""
"Langue de l'analyseur de recherche plein texte pour ce projet. Laissez "
"l'option « Inherit » sélectionnée pour utiliser la valeur par défaut de "
"l'instance."

